WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Welcome to Ward 42 Fix-It, a community reporting system for Ward 42 residents.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Residents can report faults by completing the reporting form.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Fill in the required details and submit your report.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:39.000
A unique reference number is generated after a successful submission.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Residents can use the reference number to track the progress of their report.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Coordinators functionality is protected through secure authentication and password hashing.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:13.000
The dashboard provides real-time analytics, including reports by category and status, allowing coordinators to monitor community issues effectively.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Coordinators can search, filter and manage reports. Uploaded images appear as thumbnail for quick identification.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:34.000
A detailed report page displays the full-size image together with all information submitted by the resident.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:51.000
Coordinators can update report statuses as work progresses. Changes are immediately reflected throughout the system.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:30.000
The application also operates as a Progressive Web Application. A service worker enables offline support and provides a custom offline page when conneectivity is unavailable.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:51.000
Ward 42 Fix-It provides secure fault reporting, status tracking, image management, administrative reporting tools and Progressive Web Application support to improve communication between residents and coordinators.
